@ApiAggregator.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5196

### Aggregated data with default parameters
GET {{ApiAggregator.API_HostAddress}}/api/AggregateData
Accept: application/json

### Aggregated data with custom parameters
GET {{ApiAggregator.API_HostAddress}}/api/AggregateData?NewsKeyword=fintech&BaseCurrency=USD&Lat=40.27&Lon=22.50
Accept: application/json

### API performance statistics
GET {{ApiAggregator.API_HostAddress}}/api/AggregateData/stats
Accept: application/json

